/us/app/i-am-daily-affirmations/id874656917?uo=4\",\n              \"userRatingCount\": 725122,\n              \"userRatingCountForCurrentVersion\": 725122,\n              \"version\": \"6.47.0\",\n              \"wrapperType\": \"software\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"advisories\": [],\n              \"appletvScreenshotUrls\": [],\n              \"artistId\": 1450092715,\n              \"artistName\": \"Monkey Taps\",\n              \"artistViewUrl\": \"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/monkey-taps/id1450092715?uo=4\",\n              \"artworkUrl100\": \"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/e7/c4/a6/e7c4a62b-54f8-f9f3-0b0c-2eb885d01f35/0_motivation-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-0-0-1-0-0-P3-85-220.png/100x100bb.jpg\",\n              \"artworkUrl512\": \"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/e7/c4/a6/e7c4a62b-54f8-f9f3-0b0c-2eb885d01f35/0_motivation-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-0-0-1-0-0-P3-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg\",\n              \"artworkUrl60\": \"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/e7/c4/a6/e7c4a62b-54f8-f9f3-0b0c-2eb885d01f35/0_motivation-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-0-0-1-0-0-P3-85-220.png/60x60bb.jpg\",\n              \"averageUserRating\": 4.82817,\n              \"averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion\": 4.82817,\n              \"bundleId\": \"com.MonkeyTaps.Motivation\",\n              \"contentAdvisoryRating\": \"4+\",\n              \"currency\": \"USD\",\n              \"currentVersionReleaseDate\": \"2026-07-28T20:46:46Z\",\n              \"description\": \"Whether you're going through hard times, need an extra push to get stuff done, or like sharing inspirational quotes on social media, Motivation has you covered.\\n\\nPositive reminders are one of the simplest and most powerful tools for mental growth. It’s all about keeping the right thoughts top of mind from the get-go every day, so they’re readily available on those hard days when you need them most.\\n\\nNow, from iOS 14, you can think positive thoughts without even trying with the Motivation widget! Simply install the widget in your home screen and customize it from the app. You can have as many widgets as you want!\\n\\nCustomize the design of the quotes and share the uplifting message of the day with your friends, or use the image for Instagram or as a wallpaper.\\n\\nThe app includes a wide range of topics such as self-esteem, relationships, and dealing with stress, as well as a selection of carefully designed themes to choose from - updated frequently.\\n\\n+ Read through Hundreds of Quotes\\n+ Find Motivational Books\\n+ Save or Share your Quotes\\n+ Set Motivational Reminders throughout the Day\\n+ Save your Favorite Quotes\\n+ Change Font and Colors\\n+ Filter Quotes by Category\\n+ Set a Home Screen Motivation Widget\\n\\nFrom quotes about working out to love and family quotes, Motivation has them all! Browse thousands of quotes organized by category:\\n\\n\\n- Motivation to work harder\\n- Love quotes\\n- Motivation to train and work out\\n- Help for depression\\n- Boost your self-esteem and self-confidence\\n- Get over a break up\\n- Life lessons and sayings\\n- Sports quotes from athletes and trainers\\n- Business, money, success, and career\\n- Being present and mindful\\n- Quotes from and for women\\n- Philosophy from the best minds\\n- Quotes to be thankful for what you got\\n- Inspirations for joy\\n- Quotes from movies\\n- Verses from the Bible\\n- And much more!\\n\\nAnd now with Motivation Premium you can:\\n\\n\\n+ Remove ads\\n+ Unlock all themes and categories\\n+ Set background photo\\n+ Get unlimited reminders\\n+ Search quotes\\n\\nTo get access to the Motivation Premium content and functionality, you can choose between a lifetime, monthly, and yearly auto-renewable subscription. This is a recurring transaction that will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew unless you cancel it at least 24 hours before the end of your subscription. Renewals will be charged at the same cost within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. You can manage your subscriptions and auto-renewal can be turned off by going to your iTunes Account Settings after purchase.\\n\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.motivation.app/\\n\\nPrivacy Policy: https://monkeytaps.net/privacy\\n\\nTerms of use: https://monkeytaps.net/terms\",\n              \"features\": [\n                \"iosUniversal\"\n              ],\n              \"fileSizeBytes\": \"270107648\",\n              \"formattedPrice\": \"Free\",\n              \"genreIds\": [\n                \"6013\",\n                \"6012\"\n              ],\n              \"genres\": [\n                \"Health & Fitness\",\n                \"Lifestyle\"\n              ],\n              \"ipadScreenshotUrls\": [],\n              \"isGameCenterEnabled\": false,\n              \"isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled\": true,\n              \"kind\": \"software\",\n              \"languageCodesISO2A\": [\n                \"AR\",\n                \"NL\",\n                \"EN\",\n                \"FR\",\n                \"DE\",\n                \"IT\",\n                \"JA\",\n                \"KO\",\n                \"PT\",\n                \"RU\",\n                \"ZH\",\n                \"ES\",\n                \"ZH\",\n                \"TR\"\n              ],\n              \"minimumOsVersion\": \"18.0\",\n              \"price\": 0.0,\n              \"primaryGenreId\": 6013,\n              \"primaryGenreName\": \"Health & Fitness\",\n              \"releaseDate\": \"2014-05-13T23:29:36Z\",\n              \"releaseNotes\": \"- New themes and tons of new quotes!\\n- Other fixes and improvements\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.motivation.app/\\n\\nLove the app? Tell us in the reviews section! We read all of them. Have a happy day!\",\n              \"screenshotUrls\": [],\n              \"sellerName\": \"Monkey Taps\",\n          