"public\"\n    },\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/rorkai/App-Store-Connect-CLI/commit/cafc04f024fb5ba76401ae854c7d818a84b43f3c\",\n    \"node_id\": \"C_kwDOQ9ePjNoAKGNhZmMwNGYwMjRmYjViYTc2NDAxYWU4NTRjN2Q4MThhODRiNDNmM2M\",\n    \"parents\": [\n      {\n        \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/rorkai/App-Store-Connect-CLI/commit/49cda52007bee489e0cc0781a695a46e948dff23\",\n        \"sha\": \"49cda52007bee489e0cc0781a695a46e948dff23\",\n        \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rorkai/App-Store-Connect-CLI/commits/49cda52007bee489e0cc0781a695a46e948dff23\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"sha\": \"cafc04f024fb5ba76401ae854c7d818a84b43f3c\",\n    \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/rorkai/App-Store-Connect-CLI/commits/cafc04f024fb5ba76401ae854c7d818a84b43f3c\"\n  },\n  \"repo_url\": \"https://github.com/rorkai/App-Store-Connect-CLI\",\n  \"repo_desc\": \"Fast, scriptable CLI for the App Store Connect API. Automate TestFlight, builds, submissions, signing, analytics, screenshots, subscriptions, and more. JSON-first, no interactive prompts\",\n  \"created\": \"2026-01-20T11:17:23Z\",\n  \"pushed\": \"2026-08-03T13:47:13Z\"\n}\nFILE\n{\n  \"item_ids\": [\n    \"github:antiwork/gumroad-cli@806dfc0a4bf13585a548652f8919c3dc4089695c\"\n  ],\n  \"latest\": {\n    \"author\": {\n      \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265388744?v=4\",\n      \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/events{/privacy}\",\n      \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/followers\",\n      \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/following{/other_user}\",\n      \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/gists{/gist_id}\",\n      \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n      \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/gumclaw\",\n      \"id\": 265388744,\n      \"login\": \"gumclaw\",\n      \"node_id\": \"U_kgDOD9GCyA\",\n      \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/orgs\",\n      \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/received_events\",\n      \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/repos\",\n      \"site_admin\": false,\n      \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n      \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw/subscriptions\",\n      \"type\": \"User\",\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gumclaw\",\n      \"user_view_type\": \"public\"\n    },\n    \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/antiwork/gumroad-cli/commits/806dfc0a4bf13585a548652f8919c3dc4089695c/comments\",\n    \"commit\": {\n      \"author\": {\n        \"date\": \"2026-08-03T18:35:01Z\",\n        \"email\": \"gumclaw@gumroad.com\",\n        \"name\": \"gumclaw\"\n      },\n      \"comment_count\": 0,\n      \"committer\": {\n        \"date\": \"2026-08-03T18:35:01Z\",\n        \"email\": \"noreply@github.com\",\n        \"name\": \"GitHub\"\n      },\n      \"message\": \"Scale sales refund --amount by the sale's own currency (#193)\\n\\n* Scale sales refund --amount by the sale's own currency\\n\\nParseMoney was called with an empty currency, so it always multiplied by\\n100. On a JPY-listed sale --amount 25 requested a 2500 yen refund and the\\nserver accepted it whenever the refundable balance allowed, with the\\nconfirmation prompt echoing the wrong figure too.\\n\\nA partial refund now looks the sale up first to read its currency, refuses\\nrather than guessing when it cannot, and labels the amount it echoes.\\n\\nRefs gumroad-private#1782\\n\\n* Validate --amount syntax before the sale lookup in sales refund\\n\\nGreptile flagged that a malformed --amount (abc, negative) triggered\\nan authenticated GET before local validation, so a bad lookup/auth\\nerror masked the actionable input error and burned a request.\\n\\n* Fix dry-run and test-routing gaps found in review of #193\\n\\nFetchRequestDecoded had no --dry-run guard, so a future mutating caller\\nwould make a real request under --dry-run instead of refusing. Refund's\\nown dry-run path still works: it goes through the GET lookup (needed to\\npreview the scaled amount) and only the PUT is short-circuited.\\n\\nAlso route the sales-refund test double on HTTP method instead of a\\npath suffix, since a sale id ending in \\\"refund\\\" defeated the old\\nsuffix match, and add a --json envelope test for the partial-refund path.\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: gumclaw <gumclaw@users.noreply.github.com>\",\n      \"tree\": {\n        \"sha\": \"11cadaf3271039d92694faa3b486aff615482fef\",\n        \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/antiwork/gumroad-cli/git/trees/11cadaf3271039d92694faa3b486aff615482fef\"\n      },\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/antiwork/gumroad-cli/git/commits/806dfc0a4bf13585a548652f8919c3dc4089695c\",\n      \"verification\": {\n        \"payload\": \"tree 11cadaf3271039d92694faa3b486aff615482fef\\nparent f7d0fbdf012fecf2e3426890b9b192866d3928f1\\nauthor gumclaw <gumclaw@gumroad.com> 1785782101 -0400\\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785782101 -0400\\n\\nScale sales refund --amount by the sale's own currency (#193)\\n\\n* Scale sales refund --amount by the sale's own currency\\n\\nParseMoney was called with an empty currency, so it always multiplied by\\n100. On a JPY-listed sale --amount 25 requested a 2500 yen refund and the\\nserver accepted it whenever the refundable balance allowed, with the\\nconfirmation prompt echoing the wrong figure too.\\n\\nA partial refund now looks the sale up first to read its currency, refuses\\nrather than guessing when it cannot, and labels the amount it echoes.\\n\\nRefs gumroad-private#1782\\n\\n* Validate --amount syntax before the sale lookup in sales refund\\n\\nGreptile flagged that a malformed --amount (abc, negative) triggered\\nan authenticated GET before local validation, so a bad lookup/auth\\nerror masked the actionable input error and burned a request.\\n\\n* Fix dry-run and test-routing gaps found in review of #193\\n\\nFetchRequestDecoded had no --dry-run guard, so a future mutating caller\\nwould make a real request under --dry-run instead of refusing. Refund's\\nown dry-run path still works: it goes through the GET lookup (needed to\\npreview the scaled amount) and only the PUT is short-circuited.\\n\\nAlso route the sales-refund test double on HTTP method instead of a\\npath suffix, since a sale id ending in \\\"refund\\\" defeated the old\\nsuffix match, and add a --json envelope test for the partial-refund path.\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: gumclaw <gumclaw@users.noreply.github.com>\",\n        \"reason\": \"valid\",\n        \"signature\": \"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\\n\\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcN9VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/1MQAFdrgZ06DxGu4Kbio6FO7F2t\\nWSHX4JuOIRIWBiPV0mDQdJ4KTKpPj2o/Jf5tIzxbIqh0sGpXAB/ZPL8TEbI88XO1\\n56KMdLHdwaX/nB0WPDfkjFg6qAe74k9mn+JOir/5+R77fi8glZsyM7rc9GcG1SQ8\\nt4GEuBNOTLH940VYm+IGclfAOwUKY1u/U1nYAARpiLWG0m9CcE8kVjRjhssQezLs\\nxZjT7zCNAWfm7bT/4cYCeuO0oTgUv6/DRgji6hyLv8cD7dgvqMwZXN2L5PVtWctr\\n2FKHKmVg5P9JigaEQHLphWz6BdZuByT0hk++uKVWLU49DW0blb9S+66atASYsm5H\\nxH8jjG2pw1w6D62JsIv2N7Q9Au+sGhIvDYnr89PTXeRK2oPrcSvurTPpgzXFfb3p\\nuzWFsey8tQlXLc4SQf+FstjLO9k1xoBbELfBeFMFFNkS2oB+OJam6CnGeByR7xHl\\nn7upjTdycl0kPdsIxzlwbcLiq2asopqRfIgD299ThgDVwdiBxuoqqs/Pv4bmG81S\\nTvD3cp53xCDGMMyGaF3xj9aBeXmuQOZEuoQkM8OVg61fX0EOeBvSGBvG/0ToU571\\nPQVQWpL02fBAcKePUZ5A3AXXzT7tvePWq/Wx6tNwO0lQmVi2YMOAtlZOdvzUPRmV\\naKavyQfSVlpR27ZZQADu\\n=49Ci\\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\\n\",\n        \"verified\": true,\n        \"verified_at\": \"2026-08-03T18:40:04Z\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"committer\": {\n      \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4\",\n      \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}\",\n      \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers\",\n      \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}\",\n      \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}\",\n      \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n      \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/web-flow\",\n      \"id\": 19864447,\n      \"login\": \"web-flow\",\n      \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3\",\n      \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs\",\n      \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events\",\n      \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos\",\n      \"site_admin\": false,\n      \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n      \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions\",\n      \"type\": \"User\",\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow\",\n      \"user_view_type\": \"public\"\n    },\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/antiwork/gumroad-cli/commit/806dfc0a4bf13585a548652f8919c3dc4089695c\",\n    \"node_id\": \"C_kwDORiTjFdoAKDgwNmRmYzBhNGJmMTM1ODVhNTQ4NjUyZjg5MTljM2RjNDA4OTY5NWM\",\n    \"parents\": [\n      {\n        \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/antiwork/gumroad-cli/commit/f7d0fbdf012fecf2e3426890b9b192866d3928f1\",\n        \"sha\": \"f7d0fbdf012fecf2e3426890b9b192866d3928f1\",\n        \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/antiwork/gumroad-cli/commits/f7d0fbdf012fecf2e3426890b9b192866d3928f1\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"sha\": \"806dfc0a4bf13585a548652f8919c3dc4089695c\",\n    \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/antiwork/gumroad-cli/commits/806dfc0a4bf13585a548652f8919c3dc4089695c\"\n  },\n  \"repo_url\": \"https://github.com/antiwork/gumroad-cli\",\n  \"repo_desc\": \"CLI for the Gumroad API\",\n  \"created\": \"2026-03-09T12:15:04Z\",\n  \"pushed\": \"2026-08-03T18:59:03Z\"\n}\nI am - Daily Affirmations\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/i-am-daily-affirmations/id874656917?uo=4\t6.47.0\t4.83796\t725122\t- New themes and tons of new affirmations!\\n- Other fixes and improvements\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.theiam.app/\\n\\nLove the app? Tell us in the reviews section! We read all of them. Have a happy day!\nMotivation - Daily quotes\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/motivation-daily-quotes/id876080126?uo=4\t6.46.0\t4.82817\t1063265\t- New themes and tons of new quotes!\\n- Other fixes and improvements\\n\\nFind tons of inspiring content on our blog: https://blog.motivation.app/\\n\\nLove the app? Tell us in the reviews section! We read all of them. Have a happy day!\nMantra - Daily Affirmations\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/mantra-daily-affirmations/id1202851636?uo=4\t5.9.5\t4.83809\t33995\tKeep nurturing your positive mindset with Mantra! \\n\\nIn this update, we’ve added many new affirmations and made some improvements to enhance your experience.\\n\\nIf you're enjoying the app, consider leaving a review for other people! Your reviews mean the world to us, and we read every single one.\\n\\nIf you encounter any issues, please email us at mantra@broftware.com. Your feedback is essential in helping us improve!\\n\\nThank you for making Mantra a part of your day.\nAffirmations for You\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/affirmations-for-you/id1585586331?uo=4\t3.3.5\t4.78536\t2991\t- Brand new redesigned experience\\n- New iOS glass design for a modern look\\n- Improved widgets for your home screen\\n- Apple Watch experience upgraded\\n- Faster performance across the app\\n- Bug fixes and stability improvements\\n\\nThank you to everyone for all the great support! We are working very hard to get stuff done. In this update you'll find bug fixes, small improvements and performance enhancements. If you love Affirmations App, please rate us, it would really help! :)\nGratitude: Self-Care Journal\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/gratitude-self-care-journal/id1372575227?uo=4\t5.7.6\t4.88147\t44899\tThank you for being part of the Gratitude community!\\nIn this update, we’ve focused on helping you stay consistent and improving overall stability:\\n\\n- Addressed an issue where Daily Zen posts could not be shared on Instagram\\n\\nLoving the app? Please consider leaving us a review - it helps more people discover Gratitude.\nDaily Affirmations & Widgets\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/daily-affirmations-widgets/id1671846678?uo=4\t2.004\t4.80975\t841\t- Practice reminder bug fix\nSelf Love - Daily Affirmations\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/self-love-daily-affirmations/id1591901241?uo=4\t6.2\t4.77392\t1986\tMake every glance more uplifting with Affirmation Wallpapers!\\n\\n• Create personalized wallpapers with your favorite themes and affirmation categories.\\n• Automatically change your wallpaper using Apple Shortcuts.\\n• Discover hundreds of new affirmations across more self-growth categories.\\n• Enjoy beautiful new themes and additional customization options.\\n• Performance improvements, bug fixes, and overall app enhancements.\\n\\nEnjoying Self Love? Please leave a review on the App Store. We read every review and truly appreciate your support.\\n\\nThank you for growing with us.\nDaily Quote - Positive quotes\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/daily-quote-positive-quotes/id586028606?uo=4\t17.5.0\t4.75122\t66281\tStability improvements and bug fixes. Fixed bug where notification is not sent at set time.\\n\\nThoughts or feedback? Please leave a review here on the App Store or contact me at http://dailyquoteapp.com/feedback\nUnique Daily Affirmations\thttps://apps.apple.com/us/app/unique-daily-affirmations/id418693319?uo=4\t6.0.8\t4.76616\t19766\t• Improved automatic text color on background photos — light and dark text is now chosen from the area directly behind your quote, so affirmations stay readable on tricky images.\\n• Widget backgrounds now get the same automatic text color treatment.\\n• Fixed favorites and custom quote lists not refreshing after deleting or clearing quotes.\\n• Cleaned up the Unsplash photo picker layout.\n恋愛温度計 - もしもの恋愛シミュレーター\thttps://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B%E6%B8%A9%E5%BA%A6%E8%A8%88-%E3%82%82%E3%81%97%E3%82%82%E3%81%AE%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B%E3%82%B7%E3%83%9F%E3%83%A5%E3%83%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC/id6784031888?uo=4\t1.1.8\t4.52023\t519\tトーク履歴の共有時・取り込み時の問題を修正しました。\n神秘のタロットワールド 恋愛・復縁・不倫・人生の当たる占い\thttps://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E7%A5%9E%E7%A7%98%E3%81%AE%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AD%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89-%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B-%E5%BE%A9%E7%B8%81-%E4%B8%8D%E5%80%AB-%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%93%E3%81%9F%E3%82%8B%E5%8D%A0%E3%81%84/id1247701802?uo=4\t2.50.0\t4.23025\t1038\t■新タロット登場！\\n「運命が色づく万華鏡◆幻彩カレイドスコープタロット 妃彩」をリリースしました！\nこころの悩みや不安を本音で相談できる！-Gift(ギフト)\thttps://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%81%93%E3%81%93%E3%82%8D%E3%81%AE%E6%82%A9%E3%81%BF%E3%82%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%89%E3%82%92%E6%9C%AC%E9%9F%B3%E3%81%A7%E7%9B%B8%E8%AB%87%E3%81%A7%E3%81%8D%E3%82%8B-gift-%E3%82%AE%E3%83%95%E3%83%88/id1517761308?uo=4\t7.2\t3.94932\t1026\t軽微な不具合を修正しました\nときめきの恋愛-AIキャラクターとの仮想的な恋愛チャット\thttps://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%81%A8%E3%81%8D%E3%82%81%E3%81%8D%E3%81%AE%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B-ai%E3%82%AD%E3%83%A3%E3%83%A9%E3%82%AF%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%AE%E6%83%B3%E7%9A%84%E3%81%AA%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%83%E3%83%88/id6473902336?uo=4\t1.0.8\t4.40441\t136\tVersion 1.0.8 では会話例外エラーを修正しました\nあんさんぶるスターズ！！Music\thttps://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%81%82%E3%82%93%E3%81%95%E3%82%93%E3%81%B6%E3%82%8B%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA-music/id1494428618?uo=4\t2.0.53\t4.43468\t71402\t- 細かな改善\nチャット占い Clear(クリア) 恋愛・復縁相談アプリ\thttps://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E5%8D%A0%E3%81%84-clear-%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2-%E6%81%8B%E6%84%9B-%E5%BE%A9%E7%B8%81%E7%9B%B8%E8%AB%87%E3%82%A2%E3%83%97%E3%83%AA/id6467590967?uo=4\t6.0\t4.22513\t191\t軽微な不具合を修正しました\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
